    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Part 2 — Customized RAG\\n\\n**Ingest path:** Load Knowledge Base → Download AI Compute KB → Prepare Text → Insert KB into Vector Store.\\n\\nThe Data Loader splits the markdown into 1,000-character chunks with 200-character overlap, and OpenAI embeddings store those chunks in the in-memory vector store.\\n\\n**Query path:** Chat Trigger → AI Compute RAG Agent → Retrieve from AI Compute KB.\\n\\nBefore testing chat, execute **Load Knowledge Base** once. Re-run it whenever the source file changes.",
